// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FalseLead 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2005699943" "You find nothing about the Invisible Falcon. You wonder if there really is anything to find?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2594947103" "You have uncovered the truth behind the disappearance of the Invisible Falcon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3138838693" "Crey Security has locked down all the computers. You have no chance of uncovering the fate of the Invisible Falcon now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3553838048" "Wow, so they are covering up something! Let me take a look at that file... Wait, this is blank! Oh man, they must have security measures that prevent this type of info from leaving the premises... Well, I believe that you saw what you saw, but without hard evidence Crey will be able to deny any allegations. Crey may think that they've won this round, but now at least we know about this 'Revenant Hero Project', whatever that actually may be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4103348936" "Its too bad you couldn't learn anything. But it's very lucky you made it out of there in one piece. If the Invisible Falcon was captured by Crey, you might have had a similar fate."

