"P2400349989" "Data Collection Modules"
// DetailString :
"P1565259020" "This appears to be some sort of data collection module, with a slot in it for a tiny memory card."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TechHandbook 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3605982473" "Crey Technician Handbook"
// DetailString :
"P900945552" "This is the handbook used by the Crey field techs. It goes into detail on how the tech is supposed to swap out the 'fuzzy logic card' with an upgrade every time a device is maintained. Seems like overkill maintenance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3568743481" "You know what's weird. The fact that you and I -know- that Crey is up to no good, but 90% of households have at least one Crey product in them, from TVs to coffee machines to alarm clocks. And 99% of all technical companies have Crey-made instruments. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Lets say you and I look into one of Crey's repair centers to see exactly what is going on.</A> You only have 90 minutes to investigate."
// AcceptString :
"P1886037963" "Investigate a Crey repair facility"
// SendOffString :
"P2658114527" "If they are up to no good, you should find evidence of it at their repair facility"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P26836461" "Investigate Crey repair facility"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2460484946" "I need you to look into that Crey repair facility for me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2425868777" "There is quite a strong security presence here for a simple repair center."

