// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AddictivenessStudy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2773205277" "Addictiveness Study"
// DetailString :
"P990987357" "This is the study that {PersonName} was talking about. It raises many red flags as to how addictive Crey's medicines actually are."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P486441609" "There was a guy on the national news program 'Whistleblower' who had some interesting things to say about Crey Pharmaceuticals. His name was {PersonName} and he claims he worked for Crey, and saw an addictiveness study on their products that proved they are making their medicines addictive to increase their sales. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think this calls for an investigation of our own.</A> <br><br>be on your guard, {HeroName}. We can be sure Crey knows about that broadcast, and they'll look to destroy any evidence that exists. If they get to the evidence before you do, this mission will be a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P316434383" "Investigate Crey Pharmaceuticals"
// SendOffString :
"P2187508674" "There is no record of {PersonName} ever working for Crey, and of course they deny he ever did. I think that just adds more fuel to the fire."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3111831338" "You need to find that study on the addictiveness of Crey medicines."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1303546574" "There is an uncharacteristically high presence of Crey security in this building."

