// Description :
"P1161905065" "Find the addictiveness study"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1330042545" "You found the study that {PersonName} talked about."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P907440800" "You have found the study, proving that Crey is adding addictive qualities to its medicines to increase their sales."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2646540192" "Crey has destroyed the study."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1961999737" "This is excellent. {PersonName} was 100% telling the truth. Now we just need to get this evidence out so the public can find out. I'll handle that, {HeroName}, you already did your part. <br>I wonder if our friend The Doctor would be willing to help deliver this particular piece of medicine?"
// RandomFameString :
"P1884429135" "I heard on the news that Crey's stock took a big hit when it was uncovered that they alter their medicines to make them more addictive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4259498479" "Well, Crey got to the study before we did. Don't worry, {HeroName}. We'll get them next time."

