// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreysPlan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1430748215" "Crey's Plans"
// DetailString :
"P455594781" "Interrogating the captured Crey teams, you learn that they are the ones hiring the Freakshow to attack the Delgado-Harris offices of their choosing. Then Crey comes in under the cover of the Freakshow attack and steals what they need."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2053728549" "The Delgado-Harris corporation are Crey's biggest competitors when it comes to military technology. Several of their plants recently have been attacked by Freakshow, and in the aftermath of the attacks, several key pieces of technology have gone missing. This is way too organized for any normal Freakshow attack, I want you to check into this."
// AcceptString :
"P268744647" "Look into the Freakshow attacks on the Delgado-Harris corporations"
// SendOffString :
"P2468080274" "You should start by talking to Jenny Firkins, she should have some good intel on the situation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Crey_Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1360712715" "Talk to Jenny Firkins"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1868771516" "I need you to talk to Jenny Firkins"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P818839733" "Hostile targeted!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1621850062" "I am glad you showed up. The Freakshow are attacking a Delgado-Harris office complex right now. If you get there fast enough, you should be able to figure out what is going on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Crey_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P392705881" "Investigate Delgado-Harris Offices"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1689185607" "Jenny told you that the Delgado-Harris offices are being attacked by Freakshow, you better get over there and check it out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2390269980" "The Freakshow trashed this place and good, but are long gone. Perhaps you can find out what they were interested in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P566413106" "Let's do some damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1302018921" "You don't have to ask me twice."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P4251283158" "I'm going to rip you up!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P460497631" "You're dead, hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2263762948" "Retrieval Chief"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2274829859" "Ok boys, get everything you can find on their latest Project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3303490028" "There are not supposed to be any witnesses!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1968263698" "Alright, boys, time to do what we're gettin paid for!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4154066575" "Wrappin' up these Crey jobs is a blast!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3721041808" "You think you can tangle with the Freakshow, {HeroName}? Hah!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2063534950" "Delgado-Harris Employee"
// Description :
"P3937915643" "hostages to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P4146576400" "Rescue the last hostage!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P320620174" "Thanks for rescuing me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P707356769" "You interrogate the Retrieval Chief and learn of Crey's plans"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1598302432" "So Crey was hiring the Freakshow to go in, trash a Delgado-Harris operation, then they would send in these 'Retrieval Teams' to steal the technology that Delgado-Harris was working on there? The limits to which they go to remain on top of their competition amazes me. <br>Crey's provided enough evidence to keep the heat off of themselves, but their stock price tends to drop each time you do battle with them. At this rate, you may be able ruin them on wall street before the courts can take action."
// RandomFameString :
"P3826087447" "I heard a rumor that the Freakshow are working for Crey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Crey_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ProtectorOrders 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3756868632" "Protector Orders"
// DetailString :
"P270249179" "These orders are written on Crey letterhead, and signed by several members of the Crey Security organization. It lists several heroes marked as 'Known enemies of Crey Industries', and orders the protectors to take 'any possible measures' against them. You notice your name in the top tier of the enemy list."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1497519488" "We are still trying to link the Paragon Protectors to Crey directly. Right now we only know that Crey is the Protectors biggest client, but I am sure there is more to this than Crey is letting on. That's usually how they work. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Could you go out and take on some of the Protectors and Crey teams and try to form a connection between the two?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P273525297" "Take on Protectors and Crey teams and try to form a connection between the two"
// SendOffString :
"P3816019147" "You could concentrate your efforts in Founder's Falls. Both Crey teams and Paragon Protectors can be found there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1098900303" "Take on Crey and Protectors"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3426252776" "You found some interesting orders during your battles with Crey security and the Paragon Protectors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P142585432" "Those orders you found are very interesting. They're not a concrete connection, but it definitely implies a lot. We have more pieces to the puzzle, and that's good. I'll get this along to our 'Doctor' friend. Thanks for your efforts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Crey_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3965324660" "Crey industries has continued their illegal operations in Crey's Folly despite numerous cease-and-desist orders from the city. Now the whole are is getting overwhelmed with Crey agents and Paragon Protectors. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Perhaps you should go to Crey's Folly and thin the Crey numbers a bit?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1513280188" "Go to Crey's Folly and thin the Crey numbers a bit"
// SendOffString :
"P835068564" "You might want to concentrate your efforts in the Circus or Tangle Town. Crey's been working pretty hard in there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P329348381" "Take on Crey in Crey's Folly"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P356115792" "You have defeated enough Crey Security and Paragon Protectors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3384265697" "Crey's been flaunting the law in Crey's Folly even before the Rikti attacked. I hate to think of what mutated weirdness they could unleash out there now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Crey_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3793939393" "Crey is stepping up their efforts in Brickstown. Normally it might be a good thing to get some help protecting the city, but those Crey creeps have been harassing citizens and looking for excuses to attack heroes. There is an increase in their security patrols in the Seven Gates and Ziggurat neighborhoods, and that is a concern for everyone there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Perhaps you could show Crey where the real power in Paragon City lies?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P4146029410" "Show Crey where the real power in Paragon City lies"
// SendOffString :
"P1540055977" "You might want to concentrate your efforts in the Seven Gates and Ziggurat neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3070927035" "Take on Crey in Brickstown"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3563715315" "You have defeated enough Crey soldiers to bring a semblance of peace to the streets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1366770187" "Good job, {HeroName}. We can't let the Crey security terrorize our citizens."
